HeaderInclude
config/oc32/oc32-opts.h


mzfsf
Target Mask(ZFSF)
Enable ZF operations support(OC32 ISA Ver 1.0 only).

mcmodel=
Target RejectNegative Joined Enum(oc32_cmodel_type) Var(oc32_code_model) Init(CMODEL_SMALL)
Specify the code model used for accessing memory addresses.

Enum
Name(oc32_cmodel_type) Type(enum oc32_cmodel_type)
Known code model types (for use with the -mcmodel= option):

EnumValue
Enum(oc32_cmodel_type) String(small) Value(CMODEL_SMALL)

EnumValue
Enum(oc32_cmodel_type) String(large) Value(CMODEL_LARGE)
